# Debug fixture directory — blanket-ignore regenerable artifacts, allow only
# the 5 curated fixture types per case directory. New debug file types default
# to ignored; add a `!` line below to commit a new curated type.
# Curated types (see TECH_DEBT_AUDIT.md F063):
#   - expected.html              hand-written ground-truth HTML
#   - manifest.yaml              fixture metadata
#   - vlm_classifications.json   VLM label set for AI judge calibration
#   - actual-tree-with-fixes.html  tree-mode converter durable evidence (V2 plan)
#   - actual-with-fixes.html       converter durable before/after record (V1 plan)
#   - structure.json               DesignFileStructure input (Phase 53 A1 ladder substrate)
#   - tokens.json                  ExtractedTokens input (Phase 53 A1 ladder substrate)
#   - rendered_w600.png            committed converter render for the advisory pixel
#                                  metric (Phase 53 A3; recipe: render_case_png)
#   - assets/<node>.png            node-keyed image assets, allowlisted per case below
#                                  (Phase 53 A3 — only the srcs the case HTML emits)
# design.png and design_meta.json are intentionally IGNORED — they are
# regenerable Figma exports (app/design_sync/service.py:229,
# diagnose/extract.py:146/316), not durable curated fixtures.
data/debug/*/*
!data/debug/*/expected.html
!data/debug/*/manifest.yaml
!data/debug/*/vlm_classifications.json
!data/debug/*/actual-tree-with-fixes.html
!data/debug/*/actual-with-fixes.html
!data/debug/*/structure.json
!data/debug/*/tokens.json
!data/debug/*/rendered_w600.png
# Case 5 (maap): the 6 node-keyed assets its expected.html emits — committed so
# the advisory pixel metric's rendered fixture is regenerable (Phase 53 A3).
!data/debug/5/assets/
data/debug/5/assets/*
!data/debug/5/assets/2833_1628.png
!data/debug/5/assets/2833_1645.png
!data/debug/5/assets/2833_1652.png
!data/debug/5/assets/2833_1731.png
!data/debug/5/assets/2833_1734.png
!data/debug/5/assets/2833_1737.png
# CE-1 #419 per-section fidelity gate: 1x-frame-width design references for
# every case, and the node-keyed assets (<= 600px wide) that each case's current
# converter output references (scripts/prepare-fidelity-fixtures.py).
!data/debug/*/reference_1x.png
